    "detailed_description": "<h1>\ud83d\udc95ONANI\u307e\u3057\u3087\u3046\ud83d\udc49\ud83d\udc4c</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846220/extras/605111d9db17a570db40d31b2a8bb2f6.poster.avif?t=1754879687\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846220/extras/605111d9db17a570db40d31b2a8bb2f6.webm?t=1754879687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846220/extras/605111d9db17a570db40d31b2a8bb2f6.mp4?t=1754879687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846220/extras/63c593c1cddb84165dcca04684de08bd.avif?t=1754879687\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846220/extras/79e6785449adf7a4d178b47c413f83c4.poster.avif?t=1754879687\" width=616 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846220/extras/79e6785449adf7a4d178b47c413f83c4.webm?t=1754879687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>You go to work, come home, and just sleep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're living those exhausting days that wear your soul down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But one day...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;\u2015\u2015Welcome home!&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That gentle voice welcomes you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the never-ending &quot;Days with My Sister&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846220/extras/db421b0ec847d67241fa2f6d9b12b2ae.webp?t=1754879687\" width=371 height=60 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846220/extras/396c1b6610175442f92c8f1a94c671bd.avif?t=1754879687\" width=616 height=410 /></span>Yuina (CV\u6ca2\u91ce\u307d\u3077\u3089)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your cousin. She has lived near you since you were little and has taken care of you like a real sister until you got a job.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She's extremely understanding and maternal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She'll do anything for you if it's for your sake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She has a deep understanding of male physiology (=sexual desire).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846220/extras/fa06cab85761ebaa746514092e1a34c8.webp?t=1754879687\" width=371 height=60 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846220/extras/76b440d1e17aa4280f016de2158a3d37.avif?t=1754879687\" width=616 height=410 /></span>This game is a communication game where you spend time &quot;just&quot; indulging in affectionate moments with the heroine, your older sister.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can hug your sister tightly, kiss her repeatedly, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >have her give you a knee pillow, and clean your ears. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also sleep together in one bed, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >or go on outings together, like aquarium dates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can continue enjoying &quot;sweet, 100% pure affection with your sister&quot;!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846220/extras/aa8b3adc479160c986a0ef8b6f4f0b88.webp?t=1754879687\" width=371 height=60 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846220/extras/a3341fdfce9dfe14ca94cfbf81d34e10.avif?t=1754879687\" width=616 height=410 /></span>Your sister is very understanding of male physiology, so she actively engages in intimate moments!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handjobs, Nursing Handjobs, Titjobs, Blowjobs, Missionary, Doggy Style, Cowgirl, and more....</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to conventional scenes with text and dialogue, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >there's also a command selection H system where you can control the intimate actions yourself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Furthermore, by meeting certain conditions, you can engage in cosplay H scenes! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your sister's dialogue also changes to match the costume she's wearing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846220/extras/4f11ce16ce2ca9b897cfda0b61536884.webp?t=1754879687\" width=371 height=60 /></span>There are no endings in this game! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can either become lovers with your sister and deepen your relationship or simply continue being good friends platonically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the sweet life with your sister that continues endlessly!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846220/extras/b7fff6825a2e984e45e0c621dff80d97.avif?t=1754879687\" width=616 height=69 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ilustrations by Kaisen Chuui</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planning/Scenario by 4D Megane</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Produced by Bousaba G</p></li></ul>",
